WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.135 --> 00:00:13.496
Roxy stared at the empty safe.

2
00:00:13.516 --> 00:00:16.217
"That woman robbed the safe!"

3
00:00:17.498 --> 00:00:18.619
She flew back outside.

4
00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:21.441
Detective Smith's coat lay on the sidewalk.

5
00:00:22.341 --> 00:00:23.762
A baby crawled out from under it.

6
00:00:27.425 --> 00:00:28.265
Roxy gasped.

7
00:00:28.766 --> 00:00:31.608
"Detective Smith—you're a baby!"

8
00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:36.221
Crash! Roxy spun around as a car rolled into a parked van.

9
00:00:38.062 --> 00:00:40.162
A baby stood behind the wheel, giggling.

10
00:00:41.623 --> 00:00:42.983
A man walked out of a store.

11
00:00:43.003 --> 00:00:46.004
"Where did all these babies come from?"

12
00:00:46.024 --> 00:00:49.425
A bus zipped by.

13
00:00:49.705 --> 00:00:50.705
It almost hit someone.

14
00:00:52.726 --> 00:00:54.566
A woman inside the bus yelled out of a window.

15
00:00:55.907 --> 00:00:58.848
"Help! The driver is a baby!

16
00:00:58.888 --> 00:00:59.868
She can't drive!"

17
00:01:02.704 --> 00:01:04.866
Zoom! Roxy shot after the bus.

18
00:01:06.007 --> 00:01:08.028
She flew inside and picked up the baby driver.

19
00:01:09.269 --> 00:01:10.390
Then she hit the brakes.

20
00:01:14.693 --> 00:01:16.534
Roxy and the woman gathered all the babies.

21
00:01:17.375 --> 00:01:18.635
They sat them on the sidewalk.

22
00:01:18.655 --> 00:01:21.838
"Whew!" Roxy said.

23
00:01:21.858 --> 00:01:25.700
"I need to tell Mayor Bloom what's happening," Roxy thought.

24
00:01:29.343 --> 00:01:30.304
She opened her watch.

25
00:01:31.592 --> 00:01:33.534
A baby was sitting in Mayor Bloom's chair.

26
00:01:33.554 --> 00:01:35.715
"Oh no!"

27
00:01:36.095 --> 00:01:36.856
Roxy cried.

28
00:01:36.876 --> 00:01:39.238
"Mayor Bloom is a baby too!"

29
00:01:40.078 --> 00:01:41.759
Roxy saw another baby nearby.

30
00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:43.661
He was chewing on a wallet.

31
00:01:46.463 --> 00:01:48.424
The baby dropped the wallet and crawled away.

32
00:01:51.206 --> 00:01:52.367
Roxy picked up the wallet.

33
00:01:53.588 --> 00:01:56.810
Inside was a business card: "Vanda's Day Spa.

34
00:01:57.170 --> 00:01:59.412
Our new treatment will take years off your life!"

35
00:02:00.492 --> 00:02:03.275
"That's the spa that Detective Smith went to!"

36
00:02:03.575 --> 00:02:04.195
Roxy said.

37
00:02:04.215 --> 00:02:10.060
A moment later Roxy arrived at Vanda's Day Spa.

38
00:02:11.201 --> 00:02:12.642
Two women walked out smiling.

39
00:02:16.285 --> 00:02:19.408
treatment was wonderful," one woman said.

40
00:02:19.428 --> 00:02:22.671
"We look fabulous!"

41
00:02:23.211 --> 00:02:23.872
the other said.

42
00:02:31.644 --> 00:02:34.506
Inside, Roxy saw a familiar woman behind the counter.

43
00:02:34.526 --> 00:02:38.069
"You were at Metro City Plumbing Supply!"

44
00:02:38.389 --> 00:02:39.109
Roxy cried.

45
00:02:39.129 --> 00:02:40.630
"You said you were Mr.

46
00:02:40.670 --> 00:02:41.551
Copper's daughter!"

47
00:02:45.134 --> 00:02:46.715
The woman walked toward Roxy.

48
00:02:46.735 --> 00:02:49.337
"My name is Vanda.

49
00:02:49.897 --> 00:02:52.419
Are you here for a treatment, Rocket Girl?"

50
00:02:52.439 --> 00:02:55.020
"No," Roxy said.

51
00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:59.724
"I—" The woman suddenly pushed Roxy into a chair.

52
00:03:01.556 --> 00:03:03.558
Click! Roxy was strapped in!

53
00:03:04.499 --> 00:03:06.260
A glass dome came down over her head.

54
00:03:08.362 --> 00:03:10.364
A hose connected the dome to a big tank.

55
00:03:11.125 --> 00:03:12.806
The tank was covered in frost.

56
00:03:12.826 --> 00:03:14.908
"What's going on?"

57
00:03:15.909 --> 00:03:17.130
Roxy struggled to get free.

58
00:03:19.712 --> 00:03:20.513
Vanda laughed.

59
00:03:22.615 --> 00:03:25.597
"My treatment turns people into babies.

60
00:03:26.578 --> 00:03:28.440
Then I can steal from them!"

61
00:03:29.728 --> 00:03:31.330
"I won't let you get away with this!"

62
00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:32.370
Roxy snapped.

63
00:03:32.390 --> 00:03:34.432
"Oh, yes, you will!

64
00:03:34.452 --> 00:03:38.375
I have a super dose of treatment ready for you!"

65
00:03:40.377 --> 00:03:41.878
Vanda pressed a button on the tank.

66
00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:45.761
A cold mist filled the dome.

67
00:03:48.303 --> 00:03:49.504
Roxy began to shrink.
